-- Tests for pc-general-part.l4 - Chapters 1, 3, 5, 5A and 23 of the Penal
-- Code 1871. GENERATED by notes/gen-general-part-tests.py; edit that, not this.
--
-- Expected values come from the Code: each Illustration that can be expressed
-- is an #ASSERT, cited on the line above; boundary cases sit either side of
-- every threshold. A fixture states only the leaves its Illustration states;
-- every other leaf is FALSE and every other string blank, which is also what the
-- charge generator's schema completion does with an unknown element.
--
-- Illustrations NOT expressed, and why, are in notes/general-part-coverage.md.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pc-domain`
IMPORT `pc-general`
IMPORT `pc-general-part`

