-- s 72: the same punishment for all - nothing to choose
#ASSERT (`the lower punishment within section 72 of` `s 379 punishment` `and` `s 379 punishment`)'s section EQUALS "379"
-- s 72: the same kinds, the same way, differing only in term - the lower term
#ASSERT (`the lower punishment within section 72 of` `s 379 punishment` `and` `s 403 punishment`)'s section EQUALS "403"
#ASSERT (`the lower punishment within section 72 of` `s 403 punishment` `and` `s 379 punishment`)'s section EQUALS "403"
-- s 72 across kinds (s 323's capped fine against s 379's uncapped one) is
-- REFUSED by name; run `#EVAL` below to see it.
#EVAL `the lower punishment within section 72 of` `s 323 punishment` `and` `s 379 punishment`

-- s 74E with ss 73-74D: twice the maximum term and the maximum fine
#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 323 punishment` `under section` "73")'s `maximum term in months` EQUALS JUST 72
#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 323 punishment` `under section` "73")'s `maximum fine` EQUALS JUST 10000
#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 323 punishment` `under section` "73")'s section EQUALS "323 read with 73"
-- a fine with no stated maximum stays unstated
#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 379 punishment` `under section` "74B")'s `maximum fine` EQUALS NOTHING
