#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 392 punishment` `under section` "74A")'s `maximum term in months` EQUALS JUST 120
#ASSERT (`twice the maximum punishment of` `s 392 punishment` `under section` "74A")'s `minimum term in months` EQUALS JUST 24
