#ASSERT (`charge under s 119` `s 119 illus`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to one-fourth part of the longest term provided for that offence, or with such fine as is provided for that offence, or with both"
-- s 119 is not s 118: robbery is not punishable with death or imprisonment for life
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 118` `s 119 illus`)
